WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.140
Stage 6 is email, text messages and your connected software.

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:12.105
Turn on inbound email as drafts for your review, which is the recommended default, or verified auto-reply, then run the email readiness check.

00:00:12.105 --> 00:00:17.370
Pair your text message gateway, or connect Meta messaging for WhatsApp, Messenger and Instagram.

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:26.850
And connect the tools you already use: Xero for contacts, Microsoft 365 calendar, ServiceM8 for jobs, or signed webhooks and API keys for Zapier and Make, with a one-click test event.
